enue up 1.3 times reaching KRW215.8bn from KRW95.7bn, driven by 3.6 times y/y growth in merchandise revenue, 3.4 times y/y growth in concert revenue, nearly doubled physical album sales, and 16.5% y/y growth in the segment. In addition, geographically, revenues from Korea and Japan nearly doubled and revenue from other regions almost tripled over Q2 25.    JYP Entertainment achieved record-breaking revenue, thanks to",
